r hashes. Unsupported new extensions remain preserved without an unsupported validation claim. Qualification includes identical runtime/API bytes across macOS, Linux ARM64 and separate source roots; 14 browser package checks, 95 strict-CSP checks, and exact public npm package verification. The website CI also verifies Linux x64 producer bytes.\n\n[Public npm package](https://www.npmjs.com/package/@documentdrivendx/umf-schema-browser/v/1.1.1) · [Host contract and embedding guide](https://documentdrivendx.github.io/umf/schema-browser.html)\n\nProducer revision: `b2a5b4cd062b23a030ec058c345f6953f3f1e91a`. The attached archive is byte-identical to the anonymously downloaded public npm tarball; its SHA-256 is `ca068e551370e58bbbc9fe1ebf7bb68f7f26f6f0dc67c67ccf17613412aa120e`. Package provenance and per-file checksums are attached.\n"}